      "description": "Never sleep on a slope again – no more guessing with ramps and corner steadies: Camping Assistant shows you to the centimetre where your caravan or motorhome needs to go up, right where you're standing.\n\n▶ LEVEL IN ONE MINUTE\nInstead of degrees and bubbles you get clear instructions: \"Front 11 cm down, right 4 cm up\". For caravans via wheel and jockey wheel, for motorhomes at all four wheels – perfect for levelling ramps.\n\n▶ READINGS RIGHT WHERE YOU CRANK\n• Apple Watch: the display on your wrist while you crank or place ramps. The watch taps you as soon as you're level.\n• Second phone: your iPhone stays in the van as the sensor – a second phone or tablet shows you the readings live outside. No app needed, just scan the QR code.\n• Voice guidance: the app reads out the values for caravans.\n\n▶ STRESS-FREE HITCHING\nThe hitching assistant remembers the right drawbar height and guides you straight back to it next time.\n\n▶ THE PERFECT PITCH\n• Today's sun path: where is the sun in the morning, at noon and in the evening? Great for awning, sun canopy and solar panels.\n• Satellite direction for good TV reception.\n\n▶ PLAN TOGETHER\nShare checklists, vehicle pass and loading with your partner or family. Tick something off and everyone sees it instantly.\n\n▶ EVERYTHING FOR THE TRIP\n• Departure checklists – with templates, your own items and categories\n• Nose weight calculator: place your luggage on the floor plan and see nose weight and left-right balance instantly\n• Vehicle pass: MOT, gas inspection, damp test and tyres with reminders\n• Route check: speed limits, tolls, vignettes and mandatory equipment for your outfit in every country\n• Restaurant search around your campsite\n• Night mode that won't dazzle you after dark\n\n▶ FREE OR PRO\nLevelling is free, complete and ad-free. Camping Assistant Pro unlocks: Apple Watch and second phone, sun and satellite, unlimited checklists, unlimited loading with auto-balance, the full vehicle pass and more route checks. One person has Pro – the whole group plans along.\nPro is available monthly, yearly (7-day free trial) or as a one-time lifetime purchase. Already bought the app? Pro is unlocked for you forever – thank you!\n\nNote: phone sensors are not a calibrated measuring instrument. Always check your nose weight with a scale before you travel.\n\nPrivacy: https://camping-assistant-b0bdb.web.app/datenschutz\nTerms of use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/",
